{"line":"T32.C.03","text":"Das Klischee ist ein großartiges Beispiel. Im normalen Gespräch funktioniert es als Kurzform umso besser, je mehr Leute es benutzen. Für jemanden, der schreibt, nutzt es sich mit jedem Gebrauch ab. Es ist zugleich ein Thrindel und sein Gegenteil, je nachdem, wer es benutzt.","lufs":-19.37,"alignment":{"characters":["D","a","s"," ","K","l","i","s","c","h","e","e"," ","i","s","t"," ","e","i","n"," ","g","r","o","ß","a","r","t","i","g","e","s"," ","B","e","i","s","p","i","e","l","."," ","I","m"," ","n","o","r","m","a","l","e","n"," ","G","e","s","p","r","ä","c","h"," ","f","u","n","k","t","i","o","n","i","e","r","t"," ","e","s"," ","a","l","s"," ","K","u","r","z","f","o","r","m"," ","u","m","s","o"," ","b","e","s","s","e","r",","," ","j","e"," ","m","e","h","r"," ","L","e","u","t","e"," ","e","s"," ","b","e","n","u","t","z","e","n","."," ","F","ü","r"," ","j","e","m","a","n","d","e","n",","," ","d","e","r"," ","s","c","h","r","e","i","b","t",","," ","n","u","t","z","t"," ","e","s"," ","s","i","c","h"," ","m","i","t"," ","j","e","d","e","m"," ","G","e","b","r","a","u","c","h"," ","a","b","."," ","E","s"," ","i","s","t"," ","z","u","g","l","e","i","c","h"," ","e","i","n"," ","T","h","r","i","n","d","e","l"," ","u","n","d"," ","s","e","i","n"," ","G","e","g","e","n","t","e","i","l",","," ","j","e"," ","n","a","c","h","d","e","m",","," ","w","e","r"," ","e","s"," ","b","e","n","u","t","z","t","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.053,0.107,0.16,0.213,0.267,0.32,0.384,0.448,0.512,0.576,0.64,0.72,0.78,0.84,0.9,0.96,1,1.04,1.08,1.12,1.216,1.312,1.408,1.504,1.6,1.653,1.707,1.76,1.8,1.84,1.88,1.92,1.991,2.062,2.133,2.204,2.276,2.347,2.418,2.489,2.56,2.88,2.987,3.093,3.2,3.257,3.314,3.371,3.429,3.486,3.543,3.6,3.64,3.68,3.74,3.8,3.86,3.92,3.96,4,4.053,4.107,4.16,4.204,4.249,4.293,4.338,4.382,4.427,4.471,4.516,4.56,4.6,4.64,4.68,4.72,4.773,4.827,4.88,4.92,4.96,5,5.04,5.1,5.16,5.22,5.28,5.44,5.5,5.56,5.62,5.68,5.787,5.893,6,6.08,6.16,6.206,6.251,6.29